    [17753]={name="Verdant Keeper's Aim",quality=3,ilvl=53,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Corruption of Earth and Seed'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Selendra in Maraudon (Horde turn-in near Shadowprey Village in Desolace; Alliance chain start at Nijel's Point in Desolace). Objective: Slay Princess Theradras and return to Selendra.",zone="Maraudon",questName="Corruption of Earth and Seed",lore="Deep in Maraudon lives an evil creature of chaos--Princess Theradras is an elemental force of earth related to the Old Gods. Ages ago, she and Zaetar, first son of Cenarius, began a relationship.",proc="Chance on hit: Strike your target with Keeper's Sting for 23 to 33 Nature damage."},
