    [18411]={name="Spry Boots",quality=2,ilvl=57,reqLevel=54,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Feralas. Objective: Travel to Dire Maul and locate the Imp, Pusillin. Convince Pusillin to give you Azj'Tordin's Book of Incantations through any means necessary.Return to Azj'Tordin at the Lariss Pavilion in Feralas should you recover the Book of Incantations.",zone="Dire Maul",questName="Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin",lore="I had let my guard down for only one moment, stranger. In my haste to escape the grip of the fallen Prince, I was robbed.",proc="Equip: Increases your chance to Dodge an attack by 0.8%."},
